{"id":"terpenie","lemma":"терпение","pos":"noun","rank":1796,"glosses":["patience, endurance (quality of being patient)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d4/Ru-%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%BF%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%BF%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"терпения","plural":"терпения"},"examples":[{"text":"Я ценю ваше терпение.","en":"I appreciate your patience.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to appreciate","l":"ценить"},{"g":"your, yours","l":"ваш"},null]},{"text":"Это требует терпения.","en":"This requires patience.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to demand, to request","l":"требовать"},null]},{"text":"Мы не должны терять терпение.","en":"We should not lose patience.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"to lose, to waste"},null]},{"text":"Знаешь ли ты, что такое терпение?","en":"Do you know what patience is?","words":[{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"whether (question)"},{"g":"you"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"what is it?"]]},{"text":"У некоторых людей нет терпения.","en":"Some people have no patience.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},null,{"g":"people, humans","l":"люди"},{"g":"no / there isn't"},null]}]}